SUMMARY:The Data Stewardship Work Nobody Has Time To Do
DESCRIPTION:Data Science Raleigh\nData stewardship is critical to effectiv
 e governance\, but it's often the first thing to fall behind. Definitions 
 go undocumented\, ownership changes\, metadata becomes stale\, and data ca
 talogs lose relevance.\n\nAs organizations prepare data for analytics and 
 AI\, these gaps become larger and harder to ignore. Without trusted busine
 ss context\, governance efforts stall and AI initiatives struggle to deliv
 er reliable results.\n\nJoin us for this 45-minute webinar to learn why tr
 aditional stewardship doesn't scale and how AI can help keep governance pr
 ograms current without adding manual work.\n\n**What You'll Learn:**\n\n1
 ️⃣ Why stewardship work consistently falls behind\n\n2️⃣ How outda
 ted metadata impacts governance\, analytics\, and AI\n\n3️⃣ Practical 
 ways to maintain trusted business context at scale\n\n4️⃣ How AI can a
 utomate routine stewardship tasks while keeping humans in control\n\nThe s
 ession will also feature a live demonstration of the Actian Data Steward A
 gent\, showcasing how teams can identify undocumented and stale assets\, g
 enerate business definitions and descriptions\, recommend and assign owner
 ship\, and keep metadata current and ready for activation.\n\n**[Register 
 here](https://hubs.ly/Q04kfvDf0)**
